Z||000000||rogergarrison||07-02-2001||02:25 PM||||OK, Im at Hooters for lunch. This guy decides to put my car down. Supposedly he has a 'real' Ferrari. My licence # is Ferarri, an obvious misspelling. He tells me to his friends amusement that me having that license on a fake car is the reason he couldnt get that plate for his real one, therefore Im a looser.  I just told him he just shows how ignorant Ferrari owners must be because they dont know how to even spell there own car name correctly. Asked where this 'supposed' car is since hes driving a Taurus. Told me its in his garage. "ya, rite" I just walked away and the girls all got a laugh at him too. (I hate smart azzes)<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||10
